    ["You're welcome, it's what I should do. I want to ask you, have you seen a girl wearing a green dress?"] = "Пожалуйста, это то, что мне следует сделать. Я хочу тебя спросить, ты видел девушку в зеленом платье?",
    ["Form a team with your Oath partner to complete various daily activities to earn Oath Points and Companion Emblems. Oath Points can be used to automatically increase your Oath Level. \n There are multiple Oath Levels, and you can claim level rewards upon reaching specified levels. \n A Beyonder can earn a maximum of 600 Oath Points per day with a single Oath partner, and a maximum of 2000 per week. Participate in designated activities while teamed up with your Oath partner to earn additional Companion Emblems. \n Teaming up with your Oath partner for the Utopia Theater Duo Mode will grant more Oath Points and Companion Emblems, along with additional ability bonuses during the activity. \n Companion Emblems can be used to purchase items in the Companion Shop (Oath-related rewards require your Oath Level to meet specific requirements). \n Beyonders can click to change the display stand to enter the homepage editing function for the corresponding Oath partner. Beyonders can change their own character's actions (you cannot edit the other person's), change the display stand on the duo homepage, and place ornaments. \n Beyonders can apply for a solo Oath dissolution at Mrs. Sammer's. After applying, a 24-hour cooling-off period will begin. Once the cooling-off period ends, you can officially pay the Soules at Mrs. Sammer's to dissolve the Oath. During the cooling-off period, the Beyonder who initiated the application can Cancel the dissolution. \n Beyonders can also team up to go to Mrs. Sammer's to apply for a duo Oath dissolution. After applying, a 24-hour cooling-off period will begin. Once the cooling-off period ends, both parties can officially pay a small amount of Soules at Mrs. Sammer's to dissolve the Oath. During the cooling-off period, both parties can Cancel the dissolution."] = "Form a team with your Oath partner to complete various daily activities to earn Oath Points and Companion Emblems. Oath Points can be used to automatically increase your Oath Level. \n There are multiple Oath Levels, and you can claim level rewards upon reaching specified levels. \n A Потусторонний can earn a maximum of 600 Oath Points per day with a single Oath partner, and a maximum of 2000 per week. Participate in designated activities while teamed up with your Oath partner to earn additional Companion Emblems. \n Teaming up with your Oath partner for the Utopia Theater Duo Mode will grant more Oath Points and Companion Emblems, along with additional ability bonuses during the activity. \n Companion Emblems can be used to purchase items in the Companion Shop (Oath-related rewards require your Oath Level to meet specific requirements). \n Потустороннийs can click to change the display stand to enter the homepage editing function for the corresponding Oath partner. Потустороннийs can change their own character's actions (you cannot edit the other person's), change the display stand on the duo homepage, and place ornaments. \n Потустороннийs can apply for a solo Oath dissolution at Mrs. Sammer's. After applying, a 24-hour cooling-off period will begin. Once the cooling-off period ends, you can officially pay the Soules at Mrs. Sammer's to dissolve the Oath. During the cooling-off period, the Потусторонний who initiated the application can Cancel the dissolution. \n Потустороннийs can also team up to go to Mrs. Sammer's to apply for a duo Oath dissolution. After applying, a 24-hour cooling-off period will begin. Once the cooling-off period ends, both parties can officially pay a small amount of Soules at Mrs. Sammer's to dissolve the Oath. During the cooling-off period, both parties can Cancel the dissolution.",
    ["2-piece set\nUpon entering combat, gain 400 points of Block for 3 seconds."] = "Набор из 2 предметов\nВступая в бой, вы получаете 400 очков блока на 3 секунды.",
